<title>POLAND: WKSM JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>WKSM JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.08 vs   0.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.13 vs   0.05</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.25 vs   0.18</p>
<p> Sales		    3.60 vs   4.28</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.39 vs   0.37</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.54 vs   0.38</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.01 vs   0.89</p>
<p> Sales		   18.99 vs  18.66</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish quarrier is Wrocoawskie KOpalnie</p>
<p>Surowcaw Mineralnych SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
